OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a dry
OL,6,Fand clear evening, isolated showers
OL,7,Fmove in from the southwest overnight.
OL,8,FCooler temperatures and light winds
OL,9,Fshould allow some mist or fog patches
OL,10,Fto form by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry with warm sunny spells
OL,13,Ffor most, although isolated light
OL,14,Fshowers may develop during the middle
OL,15,Fof the day. Winds picking up in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, before easing by the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
