OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fclear start to Friday, cloudier
OL,7,Fperiods later. Often cloudy and
OL,8,Fpossibly wet in places on Saturday.
OL,9,FSome fog patches Sunday morning, sunny
OL,10,Fspells to follow. Temperatures above
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
